Package: tennelo
Type: Package
Title: Elo Ratings for Tennis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Justus", "Treeger",
                  email = "304457939+treegerjm@users.noreply.github.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes Elo ratings from ATP match results, overall and by
    playing surface. Provides the rating primitives (expected score,
    experience-dependent K-factor, rating update) as pure, vectorised
    functions, so that the update rule can be tested exactly. Two pairing
    rules are supported: separate K-factors per player, matching the
    convention used by published tennis Elo lists, and a single symmetric
    match K-factor that conserves the rating pool.
